cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or dataset, please cite the article and Zenodo archive."
title: "What Fraction of the World's Watersheds Are Ungauged?"
abstract: "Analysis code and public datasets quantifying global hydrological ungaugedness across six fine-scale river networks, evaluating global machine-learning flood forecasting skill across 1,034,083 HydroSHEDS Level 12 watersheds, and attributing skill predictors via Exact Group Shapley and permutation SHAP."
